question: 129, answer 300 {'source': "What is the next dialog turn? DIALOG:\nWhat is the difference between Estadio B'Air and other stadiums?\n- Estadio B'Air Estadio Nido de los Aguilas, officially known due to sponsorship as Estadio Farmacias Sta.\n- Where is Estadio B'Air located?\n- Mónica, is a stadium in Mexicali, Mexico.\n- What is the capacity of the stadium?\n- It is primarily used for baseball and has a capacity of over 19,000 spectators.\n- What is an event the stadium hosted?\n- The stadium hosted the 2009 Caribbean Series.\n- What is another event the stadium hosted?\n-", 'target': 'It serves as the home stadium for Águilas de Mexicali who compete in the Liga Mexicana del Pacifico baseball league.', 'rationale': 'The question is "What is another event the stadium hosted?" and the answer should mention an event. The last two sentences of DIALOG are "The stadium hosted the 2009 Caribbean Series." and "It serves as the home stadium for Águilas de Mexicali who compete in the Liga Mexicana del Pacifico baseball league.", therefore, one can understand that Estadio B\'Air hosted a baseball game. So, a reasonable answer to this question would be another baseball game or any other event happening in the stadium. Hence, option 1) It serves as the home stadium for Águilas de Mexicali who compete in the Liga Mexicana del Pacifico baseball league. seems to be a good answer because it completes this conversation by mentioning an event related to sports/baseball which was discussed earlier (in line 6). On similar lines, option 2) It was constructed from 1974-1976 with donations from local citizens who were able to donate what they could afford at that time seems like a good fit for finishing off this conversation by mentioning an important historical detail about Estadio B\'Air\'s construction but not answering what it has been used for (an event). Option 3) It has been considered one of Mexico\'s most modern stadiums since it opened its doors on March 19th 1977 seems like a bad option because there isn\'t any prior context provided about Mexico or why someone would ask questions about Mexican stadiums when all prior information only mentions Estadio B\'Air.', 'task': 'wiki_dialog', 'type': 'CoT'}
