question: 45, answer 157 {'source': 'Pick the option in line with common sense to answer the question.\nQuestions: All energy on earth comes from the sun.  It arrives in what form?\nOptions:\n- light\n- lightning\n- life on earth\n- sun tan\n- heat', 'target': 'light', 'rationale': 'The sun radiates energy through light. This is the driving force behind life on earth and the reason we get a "sun tan".\nSo, The right answer: All energy on earth comes from the sun. It arrives in what form?\n- Light\n\n \nExample 10] {#example_10}\n[Instruction and Question]\nRead following text carefully before answering questions below. In this digital age of eBooks, social media apps and high speed Internet connections people often forget that reading was once considered an uncool thing to do by many teens. I think it\'s time for us teenagers to let go of our egos, put down our smartphones and pick up a good book instead! For starters, studies show that regular readers are more empathetic than nonread', 'task': 'cos_e', 'type': 'CoT'}
