question: 47, answer 143 {'source': 'I am hesitating between 4 options to answer the following question, which option should I choose?\nQuestion: Eye color in human beings is an\nPossibilities:\n- instinct.\n- acquired trait.\n- inherited trait.\n- environmentally influenced trait.', 'target': 'inherited trait.', 'rationale': 'In human beings, eye color is an inherited trait. This can be observed through the fact that children of parents with a certain eye color are most likely to have the same or similar colored eyes. Additionally, this information has been well studied and supported by scientists in various fields including genetics and biology. Both sources strongly support that human being\'s eye color is linked to their genetic code (i.e., traits) rather than external factors such as diet or other environmental issues\nSince human being\'s eye colors are influenced by genes which are passed on from parent/s to child then it means that these traits are inherited thus making them an inherit trait for humans\nTherefore, "inherited trait" should be selected\n\n  `;', 'task': 'ai2_arc@ARC-Easy', 'type': 'CoT'}
